         "id": "b70a15b6",
         "metadata": {},
         "source": [
            "the columns (features) that should be encoded are:\n",
            "airline, flights, departure & arrival times, source & destination cities, stops, class\n",
            "\n",
            "the other ones are already numerical & don't need any more encoding (days_left, price, duration)\n",
            "\n",
            "i suppose all the data in here is relevant to use in the ML Training\n",
            "\n",
            "[doc for preprocessing](https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/preprocessing.html#encoding-categorical-features)"
         ]
